hML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> thẻ như vậy).<br>Vậy xác suất của biến cố <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>E</mi></semantics></math> là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>21</mn><mn>190</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\t\t\n\t\t\tDo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>E</mi></semantics></math> là hai biến cố xung khắc nên xác suất của biến cố ““ Tích các số ghi trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> thẻ lấy ra chia hết cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>6</mn></semantics></math>”” là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>15</mn><mn>38</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semanti